   "resumo_en": "Release from Agony is the third studio album by German thrash metal band Destruction, released on December 1, 1987 by Steamhammer/SPV in mainly Europe, and in 1988 by Profile/Rock Hotel Records in North America. This is the band’s first album recorded as a four-piece, and was their last studio album to feature bassist and lead vocalist Marcel \"Schmier\" Schirmer until he rejoined the band in 1999."
