   "wikipedia": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cracked_Brain",
   "resumo_en": "Cracked Brain is the fourth full-length studio album by German thrash metal band Destruction, released on May 1, 1990. It is the band's only album to feature André Grieder of Poltergeist, replacing Marcel \"Schmier\" Schirmer, who was fired after the initial sessions for the album. Also featured is a cover of The Knack song \"My Sharona\".\nAllMusic gave the album two stars out of five."
