   "resumo_en": "D.E.V.O.L.U.T.I.O.N. is the tenth studio album by German thrash metal band Destruction. The album was released on 29 August 2008 by AFM Records worldwide and Candlelight Records in the United States.\nThe album features three guitarists as guest appearances — Gary Holt of Exodus and Slayer and Jeff Waters of Annihilator, both playing solos in the song \"Urge (The Greed of Gain)\", in addition to Vinnie Moore from UFO.\nAll the first letters of each track on the record spell out the word \"devolution\"."
